# the stdio door: a machine of one client on its standard input and output (evetx, ssh host eve --stdio)
** spec: library/machine.md#lasting-doors
** The client starts the machine itself (`eve --stdio`) and talks to it on the pipes; the command of the runner only
** prints the version and ends, because this machine belongs to its client and has no door to share.
primary aspect e95_test5 is
  process main is
    print "e95_test5: the machine is tested, not this script";
  return;
end e95_test5;
